---
description: >-
  Basic `create participant`/`create actor` and `destroy` lifecycle, including
  two separately created participants that share the same displayed alias
  ("Ola") and a participant that destroys itself (`destroy Alice`).
---
sequenceDiagram
  Alice ->> Bob: Hello Bob, how are you ?
  Bob ->> Alice: Fine, thank you. And you?
  create participant Polo
  Alice ->> Polo: Hi Polo!
  create actor Ola1 as Ola
  Polo ->> Ola1: Hiii
  Ola1 ->> Alice: Hi too
  destroy Ola1
  Alice --x Ola1: Bye!
  Alice ->> Bob: And now?
  create participant Ola2 as Ola
  Alice ->> Ola2: Hello again
  destroy Alice
  Alice --x Ola2: Bye for me!
  destroy Bob
  Ola2 --> Bob: The end
